WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:01,550
Come on everyone

2
00:00:01,550 --> 00:00:02,910
Give everyone benefits at the end of the year

3
00:00:04,350 --> 00:00:08,840
Production is the first priority

4
00:00:09,790 --> 00:00:11,070
Lose less now

5
00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:14,390
The earlier the land is planted, the more stable the base will be.

6
00:00:14,590 --> 00:00:16,940
By the Lord, all sins

7
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:30,540
You stay these two days

8
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:32,260
Help them put up the roc

9
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:45,180
I'm going to expand the boundaries of the territory further out. In the summer, I wish you good fortune and a long life. Let's go and lose this land.

10
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:46,780
Come in from the outer suburbs of Shashao
